			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1794259208397,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "QUANTAS is a research tool that simulates distributed algorithms inside one program. During my internship I built\nConcrete QUANTAS: it runs the very same algorithm code as real operating-system processes, on one machine or on\na cluster of machines, so researchers can check that results found in simulation still hold in reality.",
			"originalText": "QUANTAS is a research tool that simulates distributed algorithms inside one program. During my internship I built\nConcrete QUANTAS: it runs the very same algorithm code as real operating-system processes, on one machine or on\na cluster of machines, so researchers can check that results found in simulation still hold in reality.",
			"fontSize": 29,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
