			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1794259208397,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Distributed system: several computers that\nwork together by sending messages.\n\nByzantine fault: a computer that behaves\narbitrarily, or even lies on purpose.\n\nReliable broadcast: every honest computer gets\nthe right message, despite the liars.",
			"originalText": "Distributed system: several computers that\nwork together by sending messages.\n\nByzantine fault: a computer that behaves\narbitrarily, or even lies on purpose.\n\nReliable broadcast: every honest computer gets\nthe right message, despite the liars.",
