			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Example studied: MT-CPA. A sender broadcasts a value while up to f peers lie. Liveness = % of honest peers that\ndeliver a value; safety = % of them that agree on the same value. The PhD paper measured both only in the simulator.",
