			"updated": 1794259208397,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "1. Run the algorithm files unchanged (supervisor's rule)\n2. Read the same JSON input files as the simulator\n3. Real processes: one machine, and across a cluster\n4. Report the same metrics, so results compare directly\n5. Never lose a message silently: fail loudly instead",
			"originalText": "1. Run the algorithm files unchanged (supervisor's rule)\n2. Read the same JSON input files as the simulator\n3. Real processes: one machine, and across a cluster\n4. Report the same metrics, so results compare directly\n5. Never lose a message silently: fail loudly instead",
