			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Setup: MT-CPA · 50 peers · 3 network families × 20 networks · 1 to 5 lying peers  ->  300 experiments,\neach repeated 10 times on every system: simulator, BoostMq, ZeroMQ (1 machine), ZeroMQ (11 machines)",
			"originalText": "Setup: MT-CPA · 50 peers · 3 network families × 20 networks · 1 to 5 lying peers  ->  300 experiments,\neach repeated 10 times on every system: simulator, BoostMq, ZeroMQ (1 machine), ZeroMQ (11 machines)",
