		{
			"id": "e470",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1180,
			"y": 8465,
			"width": 476.59912109375,
			"height": 343.75,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b6a",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1335901991,
			"version": 2,
			"versionNonce": 321132406,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1794259208397,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "- Liveness: same everywhere (99.6-99.7%)\n- Messages: identical, 8.35 per peer\n- Safety: 100% within the algorithm's\n  guarantee (f = 1 lying peer)\n- Beyond it, real timing matters. f = 4:\n  77% simulator, 73% ZeroMQ on one\n  machine, 66% ZeroMQ on the cluster\n- One machine: ZeroMQ runs a campaign\n  as fast as the simulator (2.3 vs 2.5 min)\n- Cluster: 20.8 min, which includes\n  starting peers on 10 remote machines",
			"originalText": "- Liveness: same everywhere (99.6-99.7%)\n- Messages: identical, 8.35 per peer\n- Safety: 100% within the algorithm's\n  guarantee (f = 1 lying peer)\n- Beyond it, real timing matters. f = 4:\n  77% simulator, 73% ZeroMQ on one\n  machine, 66% ZeroMQ on the cluster\n- One machine: ZeroMQ runs a campaign\n  as fast as the simulator (2.3 vs 2.5 min)\n- Cluster: 20.8 min, which includes\n  starting peers on 10 remote machines",
			"fontSize": 25,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
