			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1794259208397,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "- C++ and operating-system processes\n- Inter-process communication: shared\n  memory (Boost) and sockets (ZeroMQ)\n- Running jobs on a cluster (OAR, SSH)\n- Experiment design: repetitions, idle\n  periods, 95% confidence intervals\n- Debugging distributed failures from logs",
			"originalText": "- C++ and operating-system processes\n- Inter-process communication: shared\n  memory (Boost) and sockets (ZeroMQ)\n- Running jobs on a cluster (OAR, SSH)\n- Experiment design: repetitions, idle\n  periods, 95% confidence intervals\n- Debugging distributed failures from logs",
			"fontSize": 29,
